    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Modify \r\n\r\nThis program has the Painter move and paint down the path to the red wall, but two things are missing.  \r\n\r\n**Do This:** \r\n  1. First, add a `while` loop to collect all the paint as long on the painter is on the bucket.\r\n  2. Second, the paint while loops only check whether the Painter **can move**. Add `has_paint()` to both while conditions so the Painter stops as soon as either one becomes false. ",
