          "contents": "from neighborhood import *\n\nmove()\ntake_paint()\n\nwhile can_move():\n  paint(\"blue\")\n  move()\n\nturn_left()\nturn_left()\nturn_left()\n\nwhile can_move():\n  paint(\"blue\")\n  move()\n\n",
